{"id":"n85355-1-8","stage":3,"title":"해물 · 海产品","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85355-1-8-1","ko":"나는 고기보다 해물 요리가 더 좋아.","zh":"比起肉类，我更喜欢海鲜料理。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"고기보다","meaning":"肉","explanation":"고기：肉；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"고기","audio":"/audio/645b9cec60f52032ad29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31685","senseId":"1","lemma":"고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고기보다","audio":"/audio/945b4c53d737d31b7538.mp3"}},{"text":"해물","meaning":"海产品","explanation":"해물：海产品。","readings":[{"term":"해물","audio":"/audio/f6cb48635568decd01fc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85355","senseId":"1","lemma":"해물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해물","audio":"/audio/f6cb48635568decd01fc.mp3"}},{"text":"요리가","meaning":"菜，菜肴，料理","explanation":"요리：菜，菜肴，料理；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"요리","audio":"/audio/aa664b105a07ea19ff3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30199","senseId":"2","lemma":"요리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요리가","audio":"/audio/10224a307bf15aa06bfa.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],